flowchart LR
  dev[Developer] -->|git push| gh[GitHub repo]
  gh --> ci
  subgraph ci[GitHub Actions]
    t[Test] --> s[Compose smoke test] --> b[Build] --> tv[Trivy scan] --> p[Push]
  end
  p -->|image tag = commit SHA| ghcr[(GHCR)]
  ci -->|OIDC role, no stored keys| aws[AWS IAM]
  ci -->|helm upgrade --atomic| eks
  tf[Terraform] -->|creates| eks
  subgraph eks[EKS cluster in default VPC]
    vote[vote] --> redis[(Redis)]
    redis --> worker[worker]
    worker --> pg[(PostgreSQL)]
    result[result] --> pg
  end
  user((Voter)) --> vote
  user --> result
  ghcr -.pull.-> eks
